WEBVTT

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.740
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.950
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.330
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.910
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.870
Scarlet, princess of Orvelia,

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:32.540
allows the Black Edge to join
the Knights of Orvelia.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.580
Through their victories against the Demons,

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.080
the Black Edge begins to gain
the trust of the townsfolk.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.870
What is this? They totally flipped on us.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.620
Don't trust the people of Orvelia.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.200
Yeah, I know.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:28.910
<i></i>Individual

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:28.910
<i></i>Motives

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.740
The Black Edge are back!

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.290
They're greeting us like heroes.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.870
After all those cold glares
they gave us, now this.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.790
I can't trust them.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:47.870
Right.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:51.450
Come on, this is better
than being bad-mouthed.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.870
All the people of Orvelia should just die.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.660
I have to go somewhere.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.240
Go ahead without me.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.580
Sure.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:22.890
Hey.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:23.450
Hmm?

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.160
Wasn't there a girl here before?

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.950
Oh, you mean Sheila?

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:31.120
She works at the confectionary
at the end of the street.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.370
Why don't you pay her a visit?

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:34.620
Okay.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:44.950
Hey, Riheet! How was the King's Forest?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.120
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.370
I see, understood.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.290
I've already submitted my report.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.540
I'm so glad you're such a hard worker.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.790
By the way, I wanted to thank you.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.200
For what?

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:03.120
You saved my younger friends from
the Demons at the King's Forest.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.450
The apprentice knight Kasel
and the priestess Frey.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:18.700
I wanted to thank you on their behalf.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.790
I don't remember your friends.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.990
How are you feeling, Father?

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:35.450
Ah... Seeing your face makes me feel better.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:39.540
I'm sorry I can't stay at your side.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:44.240
Worry not. Behl has told me about the knights.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:48.790
Is this Black Edge group trustworthy?

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:53.330
Yes. They were brought in
by Lord Moriham himself,

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:56.950
and moreover, their Demon
hunting results speak for themselves.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.200
El Moriham...

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:02.370
How does he have connections
with dark elves...?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:08.490
Like your mother, you do not
know how to doubt people.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.580
That worries me.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.240
Please don't worry about me.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.330
Please rest, Father.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:22.040
Get well soon and show
the people that you are healthy.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.490
Yes...

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:41.200
Are you all right? You seem pale.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:46.620
Thank you... I'm fine.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.410
You've been working non-stop recently,
with hardly any sleep.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.330
I'm worried that you might...

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:57.830
There's no time for rest now.
The Day of Lea approaches.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:05.830
Will the Dark Lord Angmund really appear?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:12.910
I don't know. But for now,
we must assume the worst and prepare.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.200
Yes.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.200
Your presence beside me is such a great help...

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:24.450
If you had led a noble's daughter's life,
you could have avoided fighting the Demons.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.290
Do you remember this, Your Highness?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:32.790
A while ago, when I saw you
furiously training with your sword,

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.950
I had the audacity to ask you this question.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.080
Why do you, a princess,
need to take up a sword?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.700
To that, you replied,

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.790
"The duty of the royal family
is to protect the nation,

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:48.410
not to wear a dress and learn dancing."

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.620
Yes, I remember.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:54.990
When I saw the determined look
in your eyes, I swore an oath.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:59.370
If you must take up the sword,
then I shall become your shield.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:02.040
Demia...

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.080
I will protect you, Your Highness.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.830
Ah, you've returned from the King's Forest.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.490
Good work.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.660
Yes.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:19.410
I'd like to have a word with you.
Demia, go ahead without me.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.740
Yes.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.870
Hey, it's the Black Edge!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.620
Whoa!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.990
What are you doing here?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.290
Oh, just, nothing...

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.330
Sheila! Someone from the Black Edge is here!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.200
Hey! Shut up!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.450
It's you.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.990
Um, hello...

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:02.990
As you suggested, we're sending troops
out to the countryside for defense.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:05.910
That is a good decision.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.830
It's like you said.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:12.540
Too much of Orvelia is
centered around the nobles.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:19.700
I need to think more about the people.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.040
Back when my father was healthy,

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.910
he was fighting in wars all the time
and was rarely in the castle.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:29.120
Father sacrificed himself to defend against

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:32.740
all who attempted to invade Orvelia.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.540
However, he left domestic affairs almost
solely in the hands of the nobles.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.410
This is the result.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.660
A select few nobles have their way,

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.080
while the common townsfolk are ignored.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.870
I must defend my people,
in my father's stead.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:51.410
I believe that is my duty.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.450
I'm counting on you.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.660
Thank you.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.830
You're always wearing
an invisible coat of armor.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.080
I have never seen you take it off.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.700
Perhaps that is the same for you?

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.490
Perhaps.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.120
Why are you willing to fight Demons for us?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:23.540
I don't think it's just for the money.
Isn't there another reason?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:29.290
Taking down Demons is
the only thing I can do.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.910
That's why I fight them. That's all.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.450
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:51.080
It took me a while to get out of work.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.660
No, I'm sorry I visited unannounced.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.120
That's not a problem.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.620
Anyway, why did you come to see me?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.080
Well...

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.870
Here.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.290
You came all the way here
just to return this?

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.790
That time, I didn't even ask your name,
so I had no way of returning it.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.450
I'm Sheila. You are?

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:13.490
Tamm... Oh, I washed it
properly, by the way.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:16.450
Thanks. How's the wound?

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:19.200
Oh, it's fine now.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:24.790
I'm glad. I don't know what happened,
but I was worried.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:29.200
Normally, I would easily take
all those guys down!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:33.080
I know, next time,
I'll treat you to a handmade snack.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.330
Huh?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:38.990
You're fighting Demons for us.
I want to thank you.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.490
I don't mind, I guess...

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.740
Finally, a decent meal!

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:53.450
Yeah, we've been out in
the King's Forest for too long.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.580
Tonight, I'm drinking until I get sick!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.410
I'm so hungry!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.120
Where were you?

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.700
O-Oh, I just had a little...

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.830
I hope you weren't at a special store
that kids aren't supposed to be in!

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.160
No way!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.700
Seriously.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:25.200
As Ophelia the astrologer said, the Day of Lea,
the Goddess of Darkness, approaches.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.740
Perhaps the Dark Lord
is coming back to our world.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.790
We won't let that happen!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:36.660
Of course. We must stop
the Dark Lord's return, no matter what.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:41.040
I want everyone's wisdom on how to do this.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:47.200
Is there any way to know where
this resurrection might take place?

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.660
Yes. Here.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.870
The ruins of the Republic of Gray,
on the Galluah Plains...

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:56.990
Where the Dark Lord appeared 100 years ago.

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.700
We should go there to investigate.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:05.160
Yes. But we cannot go as
a small group this time.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.870
If there is someone there plotting
the return of the Dark Lord,

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:11.200
we must remove that threat immediately.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.870
Please allow us to be the vanguard.

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.490
We are not accustomed to the outskirts.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.370
I believe they are well-suited.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:26.620
Understood. Let us prepare for the expedition.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.990
Yes.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.740
Ta-da!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.240
I think I did a pretty good job.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:47.040
Oh, thanks... I haven't had a cake in years.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.450
Don't you eat cakes on
your birthday or something?

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:53.040
Oh... I don't celebrate my birthday.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.120
Huh...?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.620
Nevermind.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:13:02.580
Hey, um... Is it okay for you to be with me?

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.660
Why not?

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:08.990
Like, won't someone speak badly of you...?

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.910
The Black Edge are heroes
that protect Orvelia.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.290
Nobody has a problem with that,
and I won't let them, either.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:18.620
But I am a dark elf, so...

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:22.200
Who cares? You're you!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.830
Come on, eat up!

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.740
Uh, right... Thanks.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.200
How is it?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.370
Yes, it's delicious!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.040
Great.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.830
There's more.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:43.450
Y-Yeah!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.950
I'm back.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.040
What's going on? Where's dinner?

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.830
Why were you out so late?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:14:01.120
I needed to go shopping,
and the place was kind of far away.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.620
So then I got lost and...

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.040
You--!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:13.330
Stop lying! We know you're
sneaking out to meet a girl!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.040
What did you tell her?!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.580
N-None of your business!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.450
What? You...!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.090
Stop.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.660
What's going on?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:28.450
He was meeting with an Orvelian girl in secret.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.700
He even lied to us to do it!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.040
I'm sorry I didn't tell you guys.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:39.450
But she's really a nice person!

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.700
Get up.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:51.910
That was careless of you.
But this time, I trust you.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.870
Riheet...

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.410
This is an important time for all of us.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.160
You know that, right?

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.580
Yeah...

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:08.120
Take a step back--
think about what needs to be done.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.620
Got it...

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.540
You're an idiot.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.740
Shut up.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:31.240
Don't act selfishly.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:37.040
Things are going well,
but your actions disturb the others.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.910
I really appreciated it.

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:44.660
Nobody ever thanked us before, so...

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:49.370
Don't get the wrong idea.
We're not doing this for the thanks.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.040
I know...!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:55.040
But everyone is happy. Sheila, too...

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:59.910
So Sheila's the name of the girl
who stole your heart.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.740
Is this how you want to be forever?

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:08.700
Have you ever thought about becoming happy,
instead of living only for revenge?

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:11.330
My brother will become
the leader of this nation,

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:15.450
and force those who have
subjugated dark elves to obey him.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.790
Realizing that is my wish.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:22.830
The thought of becoming happy
by myself never crossed my mind.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:27.450
Every moment after our parents were killed,
my brother protected me.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:33.200
It'll only be a bit more.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:37.870
We'll arrive at a town by tomorrow.
There shouldn't be any Orvelian soldiers there.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.740
What's wrong?

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:45.540
I'm hungry.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:53.580
I have a little bit of bread left. Here.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.370
But then you won't have any...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:02.370
I'll be fine, I'm not hungry.
Go ahead and eat.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.700
Okay...

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.330
It's delicious...

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:20.200
From that day on, I wanted to be
able to help my brother.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:24.540
I made the decision to join
the Black Edge all by myself.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.040
Ripine...

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:28.790
What do you think is the opposite of revenge?

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.660
I don't know...

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.620
I think it's to forgive.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.330
Forgive...

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:39.040
I don't know what kind of person Sheila is.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:44.910
But she is an Orvelian--
that will never change.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:50.910
Can you accept everything?
Can you forgive the people of Orvelia?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:58.120
If you want to be happy, even if it means
leaving the Black Edge, I won't stop you.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:01.700
But if you get in my brother's way...

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:07.830
Then... I will kill you.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:11.620
Yeah. I understand.

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:14.910
Sheila!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.490
You're late. What's wrong?

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.830
Sorry.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.540
Here... This is for the cake.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.620
So pretty...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:36.580
I've never given anyone a present before,
so I had no idea what to get...

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:40.290
I like this a lot. Thank you.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:48.330
I couldn't tell you properly before,
but I don't like my own birthday.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.740
Huh...?

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:54.870
When I was small, my mother
baked us a cake on my birthday.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:19:00.870
It was a small thing, with just
some sugar on top, but I was so happy.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:04.160
My little brothers wanted to dive right in,

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.620
but I said, "Let's wait for Dad to come home."

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.620
Dad was very late, though.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.040
When he finally came back
and I opened the door for him,

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.160
he was covered in blood.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:22.870
"Run, now," he said. And then he died.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:29.160
Right after that, Orvelian soldiers came
and set fire to our village.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:35.950
The soldiers claimed our town was
full of those plotting an attack on Orvelia.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.700
But that was a lie...

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:42.990
They were clearly enjoying the massacre.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.080
That's terrible...

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:49.740
My mother died protecting me,
and my brothers, too...

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:55.540
I still regret that I let them die hungry.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:20:00.870
I don't remember how I got out of the village.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:07.200
I ran blindly, and got rescued by
my current crew, who also got away.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:11.200
After that, I've been afraid of my birthday.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:14.240
It brings back those memories...

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:20.950
I didn't want to make you sad with this story.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:25.240
But there is an invisible barrier between us.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:28.910
And there's no way to take that barrier away.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.040
Wait!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:38.370
Then why do you fight the Demons for Orvelia?

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:43.660
I don't do it for Orvelia. We're not heroes.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.740
But I will change this world.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:53.790
Into a world without sadness.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.040
Goodbye, Sheila.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:04.120
Everything is going smoothly.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:09.740
You all went from cold stares to hero.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:12.160
I'm sure it makes your drinks taste better.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:17.410
Once the Demons are gone,
everyone will forget what we did.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:21.620
That's why we need absolute status.

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:07.700
That must be the Red Valley.

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:14.790
This is where the Orcs live.

00:23:14.790 --> 00:23:17.990
Yes, it is. We're almost there!

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:20.040
Yeah.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:23.240
I hear the Orcs are
aggressive and love to fight.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:27.160
They say that the valley
gets its name from the red color

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:30.490
dyed by all the Orc blood spilled in wars.

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:33.290
I don't know if that's true,

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:37.870
but there's no doubt that approaching
the orcs requires caution.

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.200
Yeah.

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:50.830
The wails of the dead echo in the Red Valley.

00:23:50.830 --> 00:23:55.790
The Demonic threat was already
present at Ogria Mountain.

00:23:55.790 --> 00:23:58.370
Driven by distrust and hatred,
the Orcs point their swords towards us.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>Orcish

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>Pride

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.830
Driven by distrust and hatred,
the Orcs point their swords towards us.
